{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe morning was bright, and I spent it in the Imperial Library. I had hoped to see more, but I lingered over the Raphael and the Marcantonios. They are masterpieces, truly. I left a small tip for the attendant; it is the only way to keep the doors open and the eyes off one’s back. I find that in Vienna, as everywhere, a little coin smooths the path.\n\nYesterday’s ballet was a spectacle, though I confess I found the German dancer Eberle less convincing than the critics did. The weather has finally cleared, and the air feels lighter. I am tired, as one always is after a day of looking at other men’s genius, but my spirits are good. I am thinking of you and the boys constantly. Do not worry about me; I am eating well, and the wine here is not half bad.\n\nI shall write again soon.\n\nYour affectionate,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795080444,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":200,"prompt_tokens":939,"total_tokens":1139,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-9NNFi1uv9Bi4TVdNhpycvSGAPD2zyQFJ","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":939,"prompt_ms":1023.26,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0897337593184238,"prompt_per_second":917.655336864531,"predicted_n":200,"predicted_ms":4911.655,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.681683417085427,"predicted_per_second":40.51587499529181}}